================================================================================
WHY GPL
================================================================================

WinBoard is the keyboard out of Windows Phone Launcher, split into an
application of its own. That project is GPL-3.0 and this is a derivative work of
it, so this is GPL-3.0 too. Nothing in this repository is the reason for the
licence - the reason is where the code came from.

The part of that project that made it GPL in the first place, a Kotlin port of
SongRec's fingerprinting, is not here: it was the song recogniser, and a
keyboard has no use for one.


================================================================================
WHAT THE LICENCE COVERS
================================================================================

The source code written for this project: everything under `app/src/`, the
build scripts in `tools/`, and the Gradle configuration.

It does not cover the artwork, fonts or data files described below. Those are
not mine to license, and including them here is not a claim that they are. They
are in the repository because this is a nostalgia project that recreates a
particular keyboard, and it cannot do that without them.

If you fork this, the code is yours under the GPL. The rest is between you and
whoever owns it.


